1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 10=

10
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:10,910
Mr. Ju.

11
00:01:12,070 --> 00:01:13,590
The rarest blessing in this world

12
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:15,060
is for two hearts to love each other

13
00:01:15,270 --> 00:01:16,590
and treat each other with sincerity.

14
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:19,150
If you let
such a wonderful match slip away

15
00:01:19,380 --> 00:01:20,790
simply because of worldly prejudice,

16
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:24,270
it may become
the greatest regret of your life.

17
00:01:32,030 --> 00:01:33,710
A woman's so-called purity

18
00:01:36,260 --> 00:01:38,350
is nothing
but a shackle society places upon her.

19
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:40,580
Besides,

20
00:01:41,790 --> 00:01:43,150
I have never cared about that.

21
00:01:45,180 --> 00:01:47,430
Nor would I leave you
because of what happened.

22
00:01:49,620 --> 00:01:50,390
Miss Zheng.

23
00:01:52,670 --> 00:01:53,580
I care deeply about you.

24
00:01:55,150 --> 00:01:56,300
My heart belongs to you.

25
00:01:59,790 --> 00:02:01,110
But I don't know

26
00:02:03,230 --> 00:02:04,750
whether you will accept

27
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:07,980
the sincerity of my feelings for you.

28
00:02:28,590 --> 00:02:32,140
Mr. Ju, do you truly not mind?

29
00:02:33,700 --> 00:02:34,470
I truly don't.

30
00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:38,420
Only a fool would look down on you

31
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:39,780
for the wrongdoing of others,

32
00:02:40,670 --> 00:02:41,750
not a man worthy of you.

33
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:44,390
My only wish in this life

34
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:48,420
is to become
the man worthy of your heart

35
00:02:53,030 --> 00:02:54,540
and spend the rest
of my life by your side.

36
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:58,700
Gu Hanyi.

37
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:02,390
You are indeed quite capable.

38
00:03:05,140 --> 00:03:06,630
This matter did arise because of me.

39
00:03:07,300 --> 00:03:09,790
I can only do my best to make amends.

40
00:03:14,350 --> 00:03:15,020
Tell me.

41
00:03:15,830 --> 00:03:18,260
How do you plan to deal with Cui Hong?

42
00:03:25,980 --> 00:03:27,390
Today is Noble Consort Cui's
birthday banquet.

43
00:03:27,950 --> 00:03:30,070
Her Highness has specifically ordered
Medical Attendant Gu to remain by her side

44
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:31,260
in case anything should happen.

45
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:33,630
Medical Attendant Gu,
simply await Her Highness's orders.

46
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:35,020
Do not speak unnecessarily,

47
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:36,230
lest you bring trouble upon yourself.

48
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:38,260
Thank you for the warning, Chuchu.

49
00:03:39,140 --> 00:03:41,020
Has Madam Rong given you
any more trouble lately?

50
00:03:42,420 --> 00:03:43,630
Thank you for your concern,
Medical Attendant Gu.

51
00:03:43,740 --> 00:03:44,260
I've been fine.

52
00:03:45,670 --> 00:03:46,070
This way, please.

53
00:03:47,460 --> 00:03:48,350
Mind the steps.

54
00:04:00,380 --> 00:04:03,780
(Lord Li. Minister of Revenue, Li Luze)

55
00:04:07,190 --> 00:04:08,140
Your Majesty is wise.

56
00:04:08,510 --> 00:04:09,980
May blessings be upon Your Highness.

57
00:04:10,260 --> 00:04:12,140
I heard that Lord Ju
of the Ministry of Works,

58
00:04:12,300 --> 00:04:13,630
to celebrate Your Highness's birthday,

59
00:04:14,020 --> 00:04:15,740
specially procured a rare wine
from the Western Regions as a tribute.

60
00:04:16,300 --> 00:04:17,830
Such devotion and sincerity

61
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:19,660
are plain for all to see.

62
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:21,580
(Lord Ju. Minister of Works, Ju Wenyuan)
Lord Li, this...

63
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:23,830
Lord Ju, there's no need to be modest.

64
00:04:24,470 --> 00:04:26,350
Such fine wine
and such a thoughtful gesture

65
00:04:26,630 --> 00:04:28,630
should be shared
in celebration before His Majesty.

66
00:04:31,510 --> 00:04:32,700
Lord Ju, how thoughtful of you.

67
00:04:34,110 --> 00:04:35,700
Since it is a fine wine
from the Western Regions,

68
00:04:35,950 --> 00:04:38,670
we should let
all the officials enjoy it together.

69
00:04:39,860 --> 00:04:41,230
My beloved consort is quite right.

70
00:04:41,790 --> 00:04:43,070
Then we shall do
as the Noble Consort suggests.

71
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:44,950
Pour the wine.

72
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:55,670
My ministers,

73
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:57,390
a toast.

74
00:04:58,920 --> 00:05:01,408
- May Your Highness be blessed with peace
- May Your Highness be blessed with peace

75
00:05:01,408 --> 00:05:03,770
- and prosperity and enjoy a long life.
- and prosperity and enjoy a long life.

76
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,510
It's poisoned! Lord Ju...

77
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:15,260
Cui...

78
00:05:16,340 --> 00:05:17,660
- Lord Li!
- Lord Li!

79
00:05:19,770 --> 00:05:20,570
Summon an imperial physician at once!

80
00:05:29,730 --> 00:05:30,490
Medical Attendant Gu,

81
00:05:31,070 --> 00:05:32,020
can he be saved?

82
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:33,780
Your Majesty,

83
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,100
he has been poisoned with aconite.

84
00:05:35,220 --> 00:05:37,070
The poison is extremely potent.
There is no cure.

85
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:39,100
Ju Wenyuan, how dare you

86
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:41,430
poison someone
in His Majesty's presence.

87
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:43,220
Your Majesty,

88
00:05:43,550 --> 00:05:46,070
I implore you
to seize this traitor at once

89
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,320
and interrogate him under torture.

90
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:49,900
Your Majesty is wise.

91
00:05:50,340 --> 00:05:51,310
Your Majesty, I am innocent!

92
00:05:51,990 --> 00:05:53,430
I did not present this wine.

93
00:05:53,970 --> 00:05:56,580
Nor do I know
why Lord Li claimed that I did.

94
00:05:57,510 --> 00:05:58,190
Lord Ju,

95
00:05:59,340 --> 00:06:02,460
everyone at court knows that you
and Lord Li have long been at odds.

96
00:06:02,950 --> 00:06:04,100
Now that he has died from poisoning,

97
00:06:04,220 --> 00:06:05,830
you are the prime suspect.

98
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:07,310
Cui Hong,

99
00:06:07,650 --> 00:06:08,950
you dare make baseless accusations
before His Majesty

100
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:09,870
and frame a fellow official.

101
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,580
Your intentions are truly sinister!

102
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:19,020
Your Majesty,

103
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:21,630
the poisoner

104
00:06:22,220 --> 00:06:23,140
is this palace servant.

105
00:06:25,460 --> 00:06:27,310
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

106
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:28,630
I'm innocent!

107
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:37,460
This is known as
a Mandarin Duck Rotating Wine Pot.

108
00:06:37,830 --> 00:06:38,830
It contains a hidden mechanism.

109
00:06:39,160 --> 00:06:40,730
It can pour two different wines
from the same pot.

110
00:06:40,950 --> 00:06:41,750
Press it once,

111
00:06:41,870 --> 00:06:42,990
and it pours ordinary wine.

112
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:44,070
Press it twice,

113
00:06:44,140 --> 00:06:45,220
and it pours poisoned wine.

114
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:49,510
If you wish to prove your innocence,

115
00:06:55,990 --> 00:06:57,100
then drink this wine.

116
00:06:57,780 --> 00:06:59,870
If you refuse, you must be the culprit.

117
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,510
Your Majesty, please judge wisely.

118
00:07:23,990 --> 00:07:24,700
Your Majesty.

119
00:07:25,290 --> 00:07:27,190
That wretched servant took his
own life out of fear of punishment.

120
00:07:27,190 --> 00:07:28,260
His death is no loss.

121
00:07:28,530 --> 00:07:29,850
Your Majesty has suffered quite a shock.

122
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:32,550
Can we consider this case closed?

123
00:07:36,580 --> 00:07:37,140
Your Majesty.

124
00:07:37,780 --> 00:07:38,870
The attendant's suicide by poison

125
00:07:39,070 --> 00:07:41,310
only proves
there is someone else behind this.

126
00:07:42,010 --> 00:07:43,000
The mastermind plotted

127
00:07:43,010 --> 00:07:44,220
to harm Lord Ju but failed,

128
00:07:44,780 --> 00:07:46,070
and Lord Li died instead.

129
00:07:46,340 --> 00:07:47,600
Such malicious intent
cannot go unpunished.

130
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:50,390
Grand Secretary Cui,

131
00:07:50,750 --> 00:07:52,390
Lord Li was one of your men.

132
00:07:52,770 --> 00:07:53,950
Surely you have

133
00:07:54,020 --> 00:07:55,780
something to say about this?

134
00:07:56,220 --> 00:07:57,070
Censor Zheng,

135
00:07:57,700 --> 00:07:59,340
why ask when you
already know the answer?

136
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:02,070
Those two have long held
grudges against each other.

137
00:08:02,140 --> 00:08:03,310
They plotted against one another,

138
00:08:04,140 --> 00:08:06,340
bribing an attendant
to poison each other.

139
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:07,630
Must I really spell out

140
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:09,870
such a disgraceful affair?

141
00:08:10,870 --> 00:08:11,660
Cui Hong, you...

142
00:08:12,140 --> 00:08:12,580
Enough.

143
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:15,390
I understand the case now.

144
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:16,750
Censor Zheng.

145
00:08:17,580 --> 00:08:18,260
Your Majesty.

146
00:08:18,830 --> 00:08:20,220
Turn over all witnesses and evidence

147
00:08:20,340 --> 00:08:21,390
to the Court of Judicial Review.

148
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:22,950
As Your Majesty commands.

149
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:29,950
I am tired.

150
00:08:30,510 --> 00:08:32,460
You may all leave.

151
00:08:32,850 --> 00:08:34,560
- We respectfully see Your Majesty off.
- We respectfully see Your Majesty off.

152
00:09:15,950 --> 00:09:17,310
A fine way

153
00:09:17,900 --> 00:09:18,870
to turn the tables.

154
00:09:23,830 --> 00:09:25,340
Master, what are you doing here?

155
00:09:26,830 --> 00:09:28,310
His Majesty personally proclaimed me

156
00:09:28,310 --> 00:09:29,100
his savior, after all.

157
00:09:29,670 --> 00:09:30,860
The palace may be heavily guarded,

158
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:32,700
but to me,

159
00:09:33,430 --> 00:09:34,830
it's no more difficult
than a leisurely stroll.

160
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:38,910
The storm may have passed for now,

161
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:41,740
but the show is far from over.

162
00:09:43,190 --> 00:09:44,150
After this,

163
00:09:44,620 --> 00:09:46,500
Cui Hong will see you
as a true adversary.

164
00:09:47,030 --> 00:09:48,030
That's exactly what I want.

165
00:09:48,460 --> 00:09:48,860
Good.

166
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:51,580
Then see this through without fear.

167
00:09:52,380 --> 00:09:55,460
I'll protect you from the shadows.

168
00:10:06,740 --> 00:10:08,150
One failure

169
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:11,070
costs you one hand.

170
00:10:13,190 --> 00:10:14,150
I accept my punishment.

171
00:10:25,150 --> 00:10:27,620
If the Zheng and Ju families
become united by marriage,

172
00:10:28,430 --> 00:10:30,190
my path from here on

173
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:33,500
will be blocked at every turn.

174
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:39,670
I thought

175
00:10:39,970 --> 00:10:41,250
that by ruining Zheng Shu's reputation,

176
00:10:41,810 --> 00:10:42,960
I could kill two birds with one stone.

177
00:10:44,070 --> 00:10:45,270
It would prevent the marriage

178
00:10:46,310 --> 00:10:47,700
and place the blame on Gu Hanyi.

179
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,270
I failed you.

180
00:10:52,860 --> 00:10:54,070
The plan itself was sound.

181
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:55,830
Unfortunately,

182
00:10:56,910 --> 00:10:58,380
you underestimated your opponent.

183
00:11:01,620 --> 00:11:03,740
Invite the Noble Consort
to the residence tomorrow.

184
00:11:04,430 --> 00:11:05,740
Tell her I want...

185
00:11:13,670 --> 00:11:16,860
Tell her that her brother
wishes to boil soup with her.

186
00:11:18,270 --> 00:11:19,220
As you command.

187
00:11:32,340 --> 00:11:34,270
Too many enemies.

188
00:11:35,100 --> 00:11:36,910
I can't kill them all.

189
00:11:44,380 --> 00:11:45,190
Your Highness.

190
00:11:45,310 --> 00:11:46,580
His Majesty is reviewing memorials.

191
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:47,640
Please return to your palace and rest.

192
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:48,950
Once His Majesty
is finished with state affairs,

193
00:11:48,950 --> 00:11:51,150
I will personally come to your palace
and inform you at once.

194
00:11:51,220 --> 00:11:52,700
Your Highness!

195
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:55,150
Eunuch Li, leave us.

196
00:11:55,190 --> 00:11:55,700
Yes.

197
00:11:55,790 --> 00:11:57,310
Greetings, Your Majesty.

198
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:01,580
Why have you come?

199
00:12:03,030 --> 00:12:03,860
Your Majesty.

200
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:05,340
After all these years,

201
00:12:05,830 --> 00:12:06,550
tonight,

202
00:12:07,830 --> 00:12:08,980
please make me yours.

203
00:12:10,380 --> 00:12:10,790
You...

204
00:12:12,460 --> 00:12:14,340
It's late and the night air is cold.

205
00:12:15,090 --> 00:12:16,080
Be careful not to catch a chill.

206
00:12:36,680 --> 00:12:39,540
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

207
00:12:40,300 --> 00:12:43,240
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

208
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:46,720
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

209
00:12:47,570 --> 00:12:50,560
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

210
00:12:51,410 --> 00:12:54,730
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

211
00:12:55,070 --> 00:12:58,360
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

212
00:12:58,710 --> 00:13:05,190
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

213
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:13,070
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

214
00:13:15,570 --> 00:13:23,420
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

215
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,530
♪I stand here today♪

216
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:30,180
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

217
00:13:30,180 --> 00:13:37,670
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

218
00:13:38,310 --> 00:13:39,600
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

219
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:42,000
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

220
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:49,290
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
